4. Algorithm – Ordering Food on Swiggy

Algorithm: Order Food on Swiggy

1)Start.
2)Open the Swiggy app.
3)Select or enter your delivery location.
4)Search for the restaurant or food item you want.
5)Select a restaurant.
6)View the available food items.
7)Select the required food items.
8)Add the selected items to the cart.
9)Open the cart and check the order details.
10)Confirm the delivery address.
11)Select a suitable payment method.
12)Check the total order amount.
13)Click on Place Order / Pay.
14)Complete the payment.
15)Check whether the payment was successful.
16)If the payment is successful, the order is confirmed.
17)Receive the order confirmation and order details.
18)End.
